# lib.cyr — the library's module list, in cyrius.cyml [lib] order, for test compiles.
#
# `cyrius test` never prepends [lib] (only `cyrius distlib` reads it), so every test that exercises the library
# includes this file. Keep it in step with [lib] (pravash and impetus found the same).

